<header class="section_header-enterprise text-color-white"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="header-enterprz_content"><div class="enterprz_header-content"><h1 class="heading-style-xl is-text-color-inherit is-enterprize">Turn your creative team into an AI-first powerhouse</h1><div class="enterprize-paragraph"><div>Weavy enables enterprise design teams to adopt AI at scale - combining all your models, editing tools, and workflows in one platform that’s built for production.</div></div></div></div><div class="button-group is-enterprize"><a href="https://form.typeform.com/to/VmiA3c6t?startpoint=enterprise" target="_blank" class="button-primary w-inline-block"><div>Contact Sales</div></a></div></div></div><div class="enterprz-header_background-video"><div class="enterprz_background-image w-embed"><style>
  .hero-video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0; /* half of the extra width to center it */
    right: 0; 
    width: 100%; /* 2% wider than container */
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: -1;
    display: none;
  }

  /* Show desktop video on screens 768px and up */
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #desktop-video {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  /* Show mobile video on screens below 768px */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    #mobile-video {
      display: block;
      padding: 0;
    }
  }
</style>

<!-- Desktop Video -->
<video id="desktop-video" class="hero-video" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload="auto">
